# ATLAS uses per-app environment files (a monorepo with a separate API + web app).
#
#   apps/api/.env         ->  see apps/api/.env.example   (DB + Clerk server keys)
#   apps/web/.env.local   ->  see apps/web/.env.example   (API URL + Clerk keys)
#
# Local Postgres credentials live in docker-compose.yml.
# There is no root .env to fill in — start from the two files above.
